{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In nineteen sixty-two,",
   "start": 0.08,
   "end": 1.64
  },
  {
   "text": "a man lived alone in a cave,",
   "start": 1.66,
   "end": 4.11
  },
  {
   "text": "and lost an entire month.",
   "start": 4.13,
   "end": 5.786
  },
  {
   "text": "Michel Siffre,",
   "start": 6.07,
   "end": 6.892
  },
  {
   "text": "twenty-three,",
   "start": 7.16,
   "end": 8.018
  },
  {
   "text": "climbed a hundred and thirty metres down into an ice cave in the Alps.",
   "start": 8.17,
   "end": 11.811
  },
  {
   "text": "No watch.",
   "start": 12.23,
   "end": 12.718
  },
  {
   "text": "No sunlight.",
   "start": 13.26,
   "end": 14.288
  },
  {
   "text": "Just a tent,",
   "start": 14.49,
   "end": 15.079
  },
  {
   "text": "and a phone to the surface.",
   "start": 15.34,
   "end": 16.786
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time he woke up,",
   "start": 17.18,
   "end": 18.3
  },
  {
   "text": "he called.",
   "start": 18.4,
   "end": 19.038
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time he ate,",
   "start": 19.39,
   "end": 20.355
  },
  {
   "text": "he called.",
   "start": 20.5,
   "end": 21.47
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time he slept,",
   "start": 21.49,
   "end": 22.87
  },
  {
   "text": "he called.",
   "start": 22.89,
   "end": 23.383
  },
  {
   "text": "His team wrote it all down,",
   "start": 24.07,
   "end": 25.491
  },
  {
   "text": "and never told him the time.",
   "start": 25.68,
   "end": 27.178
  },
  {
   "text": "He counted to a hundred and twenty,",
   "start": 27.67,
   "end": 29.57
  },
  {
   "text": "one number per second.",
   "start": 29.59,
   "end": 30.949
  },
  {
   "text": "It took him five minutes.",
   "start": 31.52,
   "end": 32.702
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the phone rang.",
   "start": 33.31,
   "end": 34.283
  },
  {
   "text": "The experiment was over.",
   "start": 34.97,
   "end": 35.923
  },
  {
   "text": "It was September fourteenth.",
   "start": 36.59,
   "end": 37.982
  },
  {
   "text": "Siffre thought it was August twentieth.",
   "start": 38.54,
   "end": 40.88
  },
  {
   "text": "He'd lost twenty-five days.",
   "start": 40.9,
   "end": 42.513
  },
  {
   "text": "Alone,",
   "start": 43.71,
   "end": 44.08
  },
  {
   "text": "nothing marks the time.",
   "start": 44.55,
   "end": 46.27
  },
  {
   "text": "Every day is the same day.",
   "start": 46.29,
   "end": 47.629
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-seven years later,",
   "start": 48.49,
   "end": 49.717
  },
  {
   "text": "he went back underground to welcome the year two thousand.",
   "start": 49.91,
   "end": 53.14
  },
  {
   "text": "He celebrated three days late.",
   "start": 53.16,
   "end": 54.669
  },
  {
   "text": "If your days are blurring together,",
   "start": 55.42,
   "end": 57.19
  },
  {
   "text": "talk to Jenny on Feeloy.",
   "start": 57.21,
   "end": 58.362
  },
  {
   "text": "She'll ask how your day went.",
   "start": 58.92,
   "end": 60.191
  },
  {
   "text": "Every day.",
   "start": 60.5,
   "end": 61.038
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 61.62,
   "end": 63.089
  }
 ]
}